    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n34280" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">pectŏrōsus</span></b> , a,
		um, adj.
		id., <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b><i>with a large</i> or <i>high breast</i>, <i>full-breasted</i>, <i>broadbreasted</i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">sint ergo matrices quadratae, pectorosae,
					magnis capitibus,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Col.
					8, 2, 8</span></i>
			; <i><span class="en">Plin. 14, 22, 28, § 140</span></i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">nemo est feroci pectorosior Marte,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Auct. Priap. 37</span></i>
			.</div>
